# Something Fishy (windurst 52) at GIL_RATE 1.75 (exact in binary): 210's argument and its addGil are 70 x 1.75 = 122.5,
# read by the engine's integral getter (llround: 123; a truncation or a round-to-even would give 122). 208, option 2:
# begun. A sardine: 210 (123, 4360); its finish: completed, fame 10, the sardine taken, 123 gil.
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-188.3,-2.0,66.3 job=WAR lvl=75
setting GIL_RATE 1.75
item BastoreSardine1
login
